            <description>&lt;p&gt;Long dictations are now protected when the speech provider is busy or the connection drops.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Encrypted recording recovery is on by default and survives restarts.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Temporary failures retry the same audio up to three times.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Open Pending Dictations from Nib’s menu to retry, play, save audio, or delete a recording.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Recovered text opens for copying, with the same batch transcription and cleanup quality.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Manage recording recovery in Settings → Dictation → History.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
        </item>
